aa095c135f344dfa6939b18e84853f", "message": "Working on Scoreboard and GameServerlist screens\n\n- Made a new hovereffect for the gameserverlist table rows\n- The scoreboard looks really nice now :D\n- Bug : when I'm the only client connected and I suicide, my scoreboard\ndeath counter isnt updated, even on spectators. New spectators incoming\nsee the number de deaths at the time, but it isnt updated upon further\ndeaths.", "created_at": "2016-04-15T00:29:56Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "167e1540cfb1f79c70963f6080673d334de66379", "message": "More GUI improvements\n\n- Fixed the GameState.timer bug I had when connecting a 1st client (prob\nwas in game's ClientAuthParser)\n- Limited the GameState.timer to 0 (min)\n- Fixed the alpha of the chatbox area/entry on instantiation\n- The GameState.timer label is better positionned in OutGameScreen and\nPreparingGameScreen\n- Next : work on the gameserverlist UI and the scoreboard again I guss", "created_at": "2016-04-14T22:08:43Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf3e09a4b4f1452973ae40aa3fdf4f617b5767cc", "message": "GameState methods now static & fixed all eclipse warnings", "created_at": "2016-04-14T21:27:30Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "57c520f9b1cf88ff360429c2f6ccbf64b78b8fc1", "message": "Revert \"GameState methods now static\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6d05bb8d72a3601e12db965b99ca7aed06c7e9bb.", "created_at": "2016-04-14T21:16:53Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6d05bb8d72a3601e12db965b99ca7aed06c7e9bb", "message": "GameState methods now static", "created_at": "2016-04-14T21:02:43Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "204952349284bcfd57e502bc5831f3dfe973066b", "message": "Added fade in/out to chatbox\n\nLooks cool ! :)", "created_at": "2016-04-14T20:48:05Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3be5d880302d01f7cbf4c9d77269f506852e1982", "message": "Breaking down my Scene GUIs into component classes\n\n- Fixed the focus/unfocus problems on the ChatboxEntry within the\nGameScreen, but i dont really like the inputlistener I had to use in the\ngamescreen to do this\n- Fixed a server bug where it would broadcast chat messages to everyone\nincluding the writer session\n- Working on the scoreboard wirght now", "created_at": "2016-04-14T13:22:25Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e948ddbf3376efab3380b21fcdf1f18fa18d0ec", "message": "Working on integrating the chatbox to other Scenes\n\n- Need to work on setting the focus to the chatbox and setting it back\nto the actual parent screen.\n- Try to not show the chatbox in the PreparingGameScreen\n- Show it in GameScreen and OutGameScreen\n- Can't type in the textEntry of the chatbox when I'm in GameScreen and\nOutGameScreen", "created_at": "2016-04-12T22:13:57Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a50a15eff26cb71a9f57d5f612d96b5ebb26a5fb", "message": "Box2dObject.publish & dispose are cleaner\n\nMade new default method dispose() and publish() with call dispose(true)\nand publish(true) so they use the thread-safe Gdx.app.postRunnable()", "created_at": "2016-04-12T19:49:44Z", "repo": "bomberman", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e673048c1a59f1114f704764c4de0973569ef5c", "message": "Death & new game corrected & client.state changes\n\n-Deleted ClientState.state static variable to  use\nGameClient.getMyClient().state and TestGame.get().getClientState()\n- Death popups and text messages show up correctly on all clients\n- A new game starts automatically when everyone 